# The dashboard lives in its own repository now (new-api-web).
#
# The backend builds as a pure API server and serves no static files. The
# monolith is still available, but it needs the frontend's build output:
#
#   make build-embedded   # builds ../new-api-web and embeds its dist/
#
# The output is expected at web/dist, because the embed directive's path is
# fixed. The directory is not tracked: it is a build artifact, and a checkout
# should never carry one.
web/dist
